From: Sebastian Matkovich <sebastian.matkovich@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 16:03:02 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 167/167] wrench: measuring on an ES 2.0 phone

- EGL before GLX (WRENCH_GLX for the old order),
- perf: wall-clock frame times (frame_time_ns), no wait for GPU
  profiles that never come, WRENCH_NO_VSYNC,
- WRENCH_HIDDEN keeps the window unmapped,
- WRENCH_GL_RING prints the last 64 GL calls on SIGSEGV or SIGABRT.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
